{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"besotted-witty-murrelet","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Surface\nAWS CloudWatch, region us-east-1, account 896586841071, host `rebar-gerrit` (`i-00880b2c7f13527c5`).\n\n## Signature\nAlarm `rebar-root-disk-pressure` (metric `rebar/host:root_disk_used_percent`, threshold ≥85% Maximum, 3×5min eval) entered ALARM **6 times** during the sweep window, each self-clearing. Sampled datapoints reached 85%+ (e.g. 85.0 @ 2026-08-31T00:15Z). Currently OK (recovered 2026-08-30T17:30 PDT).\n\nPer the alarm description, root-fs exhaustion on this box fail-closes **every LLM-Review vote** (incident 2731): Docker image/build-cache storage and the review-bot's clone tmp live on root.\n\n## First/last seen in-window (OK→ALARM transitions, PDT)\n2026-08-30 10:58, 11:53, 12:27, 15:43, 16:47 (+ prior partial). 6 OK→ALARM transitions total in window.\n\n## Dedup\nTracking bug **3a52-2d79-320d-4fed** (\"[root-disk-pressure] Root disk reaches 90%…\") is **closed** (P1). Same alarm firing again = regression → this ticket links `duplicates` 3a52. Distinct from the gerrit **data**-disk item 5a05 (that is /var/gerrit; this is the 30-GiB gp3 **root** volume) and from the authorship-pack item a453.\n\n## Severity: P2\nSelf-clearing flaps (no sustained exhaustion this window) but blast radius is the LLM-Review merge gate (fail-closed on exhaustion). Recurrence of a closed P1.\n\n## Provenance\nFiled by periodic ops-error sweep (window 2026-08-29T10:00 → 2026-08-30T17:36 PDT). Triage only — not root-caused.","id":"e4f3-1661-2319-4a76","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"[root-disk-pressure] rebar-root-disk-pressure flapped 6× in the 2026-08-29->30 sweep window (root fs ≥85%); tracking bug 3a52 is closed — regression"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788137470018307310,"uuid":"865bcf72-5992-40fc-8229-357dc7786352"}